### Health (public) — expect {"status":"UP"}
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/liveness

### Readiness probe
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Protected route without a token — expect 401 problem JSON with code UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/issues/mine

### OpenAPI document (dev profile only); Swagger UI: {{host}}/swagger-ui.html
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
